External float-plane publication and bounded-run cancellation.
Co-created with GPT (OpenAI), 2026-11-11. See NOTICE for project terms.

Preallocation does not prove pixel coverage. Require complete, non-overlapping
rows before sealing; owned outputs are invalidated on failure or cancellation.
Share the point/FIR worker executor, handle short and interrupted positional
I/O, and check cancellation at I/O and GPU boundaries. Valid kernel math and
order are unchanged. These helpers remain outside production Pipeline.

